earning/C138-53","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#8-summarization요약","content":"검색된 문서를 요약하는 것은 RAG 프로세스에서 매우 중요함"},"659":{"id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138-54","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#8-summarization요약","content":"검색 결과의 중복되거나 불필요한 정보는 LLM의 정확한 응답 생성을 방해"},"660":{"id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138-55","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#8-summarization요약","content":"긴 프롬프트는 LLM의 추론 프로세스를 느리게 함"},"661":{"id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138-56","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#8-summarization요약","content":"Selective Context"},"662":{"id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138-57","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#8-summarization요약","content":"입력 context에서 중복된 정보를 제거"},"663":{"id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138-58","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#9-generator-fine-tuning미세-조정","content":"관련 문서와 비관련 문서를 혼합한 데이터를 학습하여 LLM의 성능 향상"},"664":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","type":"page","content":"EurekaCodes 청구 가이드","tags":[],"url":"/docs/business/billing/C143"},"665":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-0","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143","content":"해당 문서는 EurekaCodes Admin 페이지에서 특정 고객이 사용한 서비스(Product)에 대해 청구하는 프로세스를 설명합니다. ---\n상품 (Catalog) : 유레카코즈에서 판매하는 모듈 정보. 유저가 해당 상품을 신청(구매)할 수 있음."},"666":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-1","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#1-개요","content":"1. 개요"},"667":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-2","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#2-용어-정의","content":"2. 용어 정의"},"668":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-3","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#3-프로세스-개요","content":"3. 프로세스 개요"},"669":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-4","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#4-상세-프로세스","content":"4. 상세 프로세스"},"670":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-5","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#1-고객의-서비스-목록-확인","content":"1) 고객의 서비스 목록 확인"},"671":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-6","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#2-청구-생성","content":"2) 청구 생성"},"672":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-7","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#3-인보이스-생성","content":"3) 인보이스 생성"},"673":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-8","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#1-개요","content":"해당 문서는 EurekaCodes Admin 페이지에서 특정 고객이 사용한 서비스(Product)에 대해 청구하는 프로세스를 설명합니다."},"674":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-9","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#2-용어-정의","content":"상품 (Catalog) : 유레카코즈에서 판매하는 모듈 정보. 유저가 해당 상품을 신청(구매)할 수 있음. (ex: EurekaBox, EurekaKit 등)"},"675":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-10","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#2-용어-정의","content":"서비스 (Product) : 유저가 상품을 신청(구매)할 경우 생성되는 정보. 즉, 유저의 상품 이용 정보."},"676":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-11","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#2-용어-정의","content":"청구 (Billing) : 단일 서비스에 대한 이용량 및 사용량을 산정한 정보. 기본적으로 유저별로 월마다 생성함."},"677":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-12","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#2-용어-정의","content":"인보이스 (Invoice) : N건의 청구를 취합하여 최종 결제 금액을 산정한 정보. 해당 정보 및 유저의 결제수단을 통해 결제상태를 관리함."},"678":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-13","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#3-프로세스-개요","content":"고객의 서비스 목록 확인"},"679":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-14","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#3-프로세스-개요","content":"청구 생성"},"680":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-15","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#3-프로세스-개요","content":"인보이스 생성"},"681":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-16","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#1-고객의-서비스-목록-확인","content":"고객들의 서비스 이용 현황을 확인하기 위해 서비스 목록 페이지로 이동합니다. (청구관리 > 서비스목록)"},"682":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-17","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#1-고객의-서비스-목록-확인","content":"해당 페이지에는 모든 고객의 서비스 신청 현황이 표기됩니다."},"683":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-18","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#1-고객의-서비스-목록-확인","content":"2025년 05월 기준, 실제 청구가 필요한 업체에 대한 서비스 집합은 다음과 같습니다."},"684":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-19","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#1-고객의-서비스-목록-확인","content":"시큐어넷 : 1000011 ~ 1000016"},"685":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-20","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#1-고객의-서비스-목록-확인","content":"그로잉살롱 : 1000017 ~ 1000022"},"686":{"id":"/docs/business/billing/C143-21","page_id":"/docs/business/billing/C143","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/business/billing/C143#2-청구-생성","content":"월마다 각 서비스별로 청구 등록을 처리해주어야 합니다. 목록에서