,"content":"RANK.AVG 함수는 순위가 같다면 동일 순위의 평균값을 표시합니다. F와 G의 총점이 246점으로 같으므로 3위와 4위의 중간인 3.5로 표시됩니다."},"3190":{"id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C309","page_id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C309","type":"page","content":"CLI 설치 가이드 on Linux","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C309"},"3191":{"id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C309-0","page_id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C309","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C309","content":"https://dev."},"3192":{"id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C309-1","page_id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C309","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C309","content":"https://dev.to/aws/the-essential-guide-to-installing-amazon-q-developer-cli-on-linux-headless-and-desktop-3bo7"},"3193":{"id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310","page_id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310","type":"page","content":"MCP 설정 가이드","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310"},"3194":{"id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310-0","page_id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310","content":"Requirements\nnode. js\nuv\n맥 사용자라면 brew install uv /. aws/amazonq/cli-agents/ 폴더 아래에 보면, default. json 파일이 존재합니다. (다른 이름으로 존재할 수도 있습니다. ) default."},"3195":{"id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310-1","page_id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310#q-developer-in-cli","content":"Q Developer in CLI"},"3196":{"id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310-2","page_id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310","content":"Requirements"},"3197":{"id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310-3","page_id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310","content":"node.js"},"3198":{"id":"/docs/development/ai-tools/C308/C310-4","page